---
title: Source and catalog acquisition
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Source and catalog acquisition
  accDescr: The baked-in catalog is fetched as JSON. The user adds a listed source by name. Only that source is downloaded as an HTTPS archive, validated, and used for packages.

  CatalogUrl[Baked-in catalog URL] --> CatalogFetch[Fetch catalog JSON]
  CatalogFetch --> CatalogSnap[Source repository snapshot]
  CatalogSnap --> Browse[Browse name and description]
  Browse -->|opt in| SourceFetch[GET listed HTTPS archive]
  SourceFetch --> Validate[Validate tree and skill-manager.json]
  Validate --> SourceSnap[Source snapshot]
  SourceSnap --> Packages[Packages in the main catalog]
